---
permalink: /ocr/index.html
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head>
<meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>{{ ocr.config.title }}</title>
<meta name="description" content="Documented cross-benchmark OCR scores, pricing and historical release cohorts.">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/benchmark.css">
<script>(function(){try{document.documentElement.dataset.theme=localStorage.getItem('bench-theme')||(matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: dark)').matches?'dark':'light')}catch(e){}})();</script>
</head><body><main>
<header class="hero"><div><small class="eyebrow">Voshart / Benchmarks</small><h1>{{ ocr.config.title }}</h1><p>{{ ocr.config.description }}</p></div><button class="quiet" id="themeToggle" type="button" aria-label="Toggle light and dark mode">Theme</button></header>
<section class="history-bar" aria-label="Historical model release cutoff"><div class="hist-head"><span>Model cutoff <strong id="historyDate">{{ ocr.config.snapshot_date }}</strong></span><button type="button" class="quiet" id="historyLatest">Latest</button></div><input type="range" id="historyRange" min="0" max="365" step="1" value="365" aria-label="Release date cutoff"><div class="axis"><span id="rangeStart">2025</span><span id="rangeEnd">{{ ocr.config.snapshot_date }}</span></div><small id="historyStatus">Current model cohort</small></section>
<nav class="views" aria-label="Matrix views"><button type="button" data-view="all" class="active">Matrix</button><button type="button" data-view="structure">Structure</button><button type="button" data-view="robust">Robustness</button><button type="button" data-view="multilingual">Multilingual</button><button type="button" data-view="production">Production</button><button type="button" data-view="secondary">Secondary</button><button type="button" data-view="price">Pricing</button></nav>
<section id="matrixPanel"><div class="controls"><input id="modelSearch" type="search" placeholder="Search models…" aria-label="Search models"><select id="coverage"><option value="1">1+ families</option><option value="2">2+ families</option><option value="3">3+ families</option><option value="4" selected>4+ families</option><option value="5">5+ families</option></select><select id="access"><option value="all">All models</option><option value="open">Open weights</option><option value="closed">Closed / hosted</option><option value="unreleased">Unreleased weights</option><option value="unknown">Unknown access</option></select></div>
<div class="table-scroll"><table id="matrixTable"><thead><tr id="matrixHead"><th scope="col">Model</th><th scope="col">Rank index</th>{% for test in ocr.initial.columns %}<th scope="col" title="{{ test.label }}">{{ test.short }}</th>{% endfor %}<th scope="col">$/1k pages</th></tr></thead><tbody id="matrixBody">
{% for row in ocr.initial.rows %}<tr><th scope="row" title="{{ row.name }}">{{ row.name }}</th><td class="index">{% if row.rank != null %}{{ row.rank | value('percent') }}{% else %}—{% endif %}</td>{% for test in ocr.initial.columns %}{% set obs = row.scores[test.id] %}{% if obs %}<td class="score" style="--shade:{{ obs.value | shade(ocr.initial.ranges[test.id]) }}" title="{{ obs.source_id }}">{{ obs.value | value(test.unit) }}{% if obs.evidence in ['author_reported','vendor_internal','secondary','assumed','vendor_comparison'] %}<sup>{% if obs.evidence == 'assumed' %}*{% else %}†{% endif %}</sup>{% endif %}</td>{% else %}<td class="score">—</td>{% endif %}{% endfor %}<td class="price">{% if row.price != null %}${{ row.price | value('percent') }}{% else %}—{% endif %}</td></tr>{% endfor %}
</tbody></table></div><p class="key">* open-model floor · † qualified / author-reported · — no comparable result</p>
</section>
<section id="pricingPanel" hidden><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>Model</th><th>USD / 1,000 pages</th><th>Basis</th><th>As of</th></tr></thead><tbody>{% for p in ocr.pricing %}<tr><td>{{ ocr.modelNameById[p.model] or p.model }}</td><td>${{ p.usd_per_1000_pages | value('percent') }}</td><td>{{ p.basis }}</td><td>{{ p.as_of }}</td></tr>{% endfor %}</tbody></table></div></section>
<details class="method"><summary>Methodology, provenance & sources</summary><p>Each mature independent benchmark contributes one equal vote to the mean percentile-rank index. A benchmark is included only when the historical cohort has six scored models from three organizations. At least three core families are required for a Rank index; 4+ primary families is the default display filter.</p><p>Author-reported, internal, and small-sample results are shown but are excluded from the core Rank unless corroborated by comparable evaluation. Dates are model release dates, not benchmark publication dates. Scores and prices are source-specific; historical views are retrospective cohorts, not archived leaderboards.</p><p>Some older records were migrated from an existing research snapshot; their source links are preserved, but they have not all been independently re-run. Missing model releases are omitted from historic cohorts until the current snapshot.</p><div class="source-grid">{% for id, source in ocr.sources %}<p><a href="{{ source.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">{{ source.title }}</a> <small>— {{ source.note }}</small></p>{% endfor %}</div></details>
<footer><a href="/">All benchmarks</a> · <a href="https://github.com/voshart/benchmarks">Source repository</a> · Research snapshot {{ ocr.config.snapshot_date }}</footer>
</main><script defer src="/assets/js/ranking.js"></script><script defer src="/assets/js/bench.js"></script></body></html>
